  "bodyHash": "I1O4nTsd1f4=",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">總覽</span></strong></h1><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;這個模組包最初是為朋友設計的，但在花費了許多時間製作之後，我決定將其公開，讓其他人也能享受更棒的 OneBlock 體驗！</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">歡迎分享任何<span style=\"color:#169179\">建議</span>，或回報您發現的<span style=\"color:#169179\">錯誤</span>或<span style=\"color:#169179\">故障</span><span style=\"color:#169179\">！</span><br></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">！！！</span>請在更新模組包前<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">備份<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">您的</span>世界</span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">！！！</span><br></span></span></h3><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;此模組包基於原始的 OneBlock「模組」，您會在單一草方塊上出生，需要破壞它以推進到下一個階段，解鎖更多方塊。它包含 <strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">0</span></strong> 個結構模組，這使得模組包非常容易更新。</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">效能</span></strong></h1><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">它應該是目前</span>&nbsp;<strong>效能最好的模組包！</strong> 內含超過 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">45 個效能優化模組</span>，一切從<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">單一方塊開始</span>，其他模組則是小型的附加內容和模組庫，其中最大的模組是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chipped</a>。</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">常見問題</span></strong></h1><p><span style=\"color:#000\">問：如何建立新世界？</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>答：目前，您必須使用「建立新世界」按鈕下方的「重新建立」功能，該功能僅適用於第一個「OneBlock」（非「原始」）世界。</p>\n</div><p><span style=\"color:#000\">問：無限耐久度？</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>如何停用：打開您的模組資料夾，刪除「What Durability?」模組。</p>\n<p>為什麼？：耐久度最終變得比有意義更繁瑣，特別是多數人使用修補附魔，這實際上讓耐久度變得無關緊要。這個模組也讓金工具變得有用！</p>\n</div><p><span style=\"color:#000\">問：恐怖模組？</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>答：「恐怖」模組名為「Distant Friends」。它只會生成一些遠處的實體，主要使用全黑皮膚。這些身影在被注視時會做出反應，並在您靠近時消失。</p>\n</div><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252frazvangn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1090118/description_b209548d-33c6-4553-b2f4-4b01b2e64f44.png\" width=\"476\" height=\"80\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/AeuBs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1090118/description_4b9c9228-1223-419b-92e7-756819aad08f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"300\"></a></span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\">計劃中的功能：</span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>以下模組可能根據相容性、功能及需求而新增或不新增：</em><br><br><em>更多獨特的相關進度。</em><br><em>原版物品的自訂合成配方。</em><br><em>無生物破壞。</em></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cursery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cursery</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblegen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CobbleGen</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchancement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sneaky-curses-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sneaky Curses</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-tabs-updated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Tabs</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vectorientation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vectorientation</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mobtimizations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mobtimizations</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-snow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Snow</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smooth-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smooth Particles</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fluid-void-fading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fluid Void Fading</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/whats-that-slot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">What's That Slot?</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-crosshair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Crosshair</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beneath-the-wetlands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beneath the Wetlands</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backported-spears\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backported Spears</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Portals</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-compass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Compass</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Furniture</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fxs-rail-optimization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FX's Rail Optimization</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/coffeegs-awful-lightning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CoffeeG's Awful Lightning!</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-but-better\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Building But Better</a> vs <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/handcrafted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Handcrafted</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-progressive-bosses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Progressive Bosses</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillatweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">VanillaTweaks</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/odds-ends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Odds &amp; Ends</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpet-fixes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Carpet-Fixes</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goblin-traders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Goblin Traders</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-starlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eternal Starlight</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hold-my-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hold my Items</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moreculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreCulling</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blanket\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blanket</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">New Default+</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/everything-animated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Everything Animated!</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-oneblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucky OneBlock - Lucky Blocks</a></p>",
